674f189b97e50509344ce4985b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2746b939/uploads/origins/0b7846f9-e980-46f6-b530-82d7e10b9866?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10d09bd9a93d129ea1edbcac864543b0 3x"}, "body": "deeply forested\n\nThank you very much for your continued support!\nThis time, I would like to ask Mr. Hayashi to send me a request for one picture...!\n\nRequest details\nI would like you to draw an illustration of Hinatsu Kaitsuki.\nI would be happy if she wears a warm, autumn/winter-like outfit...!\nPlease leave the design, hairstyle, etc. to Ms. Rinzaki.\n\n\nPossible uses\nThumbnails for YouTube\nGood morning/good night VTuber (on X)\nUse as part of FANBOX benefits\nNet prints\nUse as an image for activities\n\n\nFile Format\nWe would appreciate PSD or transparent PNG files with a background for use as thumbnails, etc.\n\n\nOthers\nWe would be happy to receive a full body image if possible,\nIf you would like a bust-up, we would appreciate it if you could use a composition that does not show off the side of the hair or hands.\n\n\nIf possible, I would be very happy if you could accept my request!\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1HP_YouQiKkfbwuDDfu3U0mQ7bnHVzXAV", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@_rin2do/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b4ded976/uploads/origins/7ac5f1af-38c1-43fa-98e8-1794214b78db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=63e8713d9e93f9dabc8aa91e55c9ee2f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b4ded976/uploads/origins/7ac5f1af-38c1-43fa-98e8-1794214b78db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=63e